    <string name="brp_osc_two_controllers_touch_on">This app also sends every finger to the computer, so Big Remote Play\'s Touch controls (drawn by the computer) work too. Use one of the two: with both, the game sees two controllers. In Game Window, use the controller on this phone.</string>
    <string name="brp_osc_two_controllers_touch_off">Touch is sent as a mouse (native touch is off in Settings), so the computer\'s Touch controls do not work; use the controller on this phone.</string>
    <string name="brp_osc_more_in_settings">Buttons shown, vibration and the stick dead zone are in Settings and apply to the next stream.</string>

